# 게임 페이지에 붙는 보안 헤더 (클라우드플레어가 읽고, 파일 자체는 공개되지 않음)
/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  X-Frame-Options: SAMEORIGIN
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=(), payment=(), usb=()
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' https://gc.zgo.at; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' https://fonts.googleapis.com; font-src 'self' https://fonts.gstatic.com; img-src 'self' data: blob: https://jeonghun9206.goatcounter.com; connect-src 'self' https://jeonghun9206.goatcounter.com; manifest-src 'self'; worker-src 'self'; frame-ancestors 'self'; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'self'; object-src 'none'
